sequenceDiagram
  actor O as Office user
  participant R as Review screen
  participant D as Phone disk
  participant B as Backend
  participant L as mapping.py
  O->>R: Review job / Past jobs
  R->>B: GET /jobs/{id}
  alt finalized record
    B-->>R: job record
  else 404 or unreachable
    R->>D: session.json: local view
  end
  R->>D: load photos
  O->>R: tap photo: full screen
  O->>R: tap field, pick or type value
  R->>B: POST .../captures/{cid}/fields/{name}
  B->>B: check value, choices, size range
  B->>B: source human, conf 1.0, previous = AI
  B->>L: rebuild line items (typed size = measured)
  L-->>B: new estimate
  B->>B: schema check, write cid.json + record
  B-->>R: updated record
  Note over B: later finalize reads cid.json, edit survives
